e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F_iQeKdhRt0Q7kNvwFs1fNf&_nc_oc=Adq4FuS8WkVs_QEJZMZvL8fmfw3WrqMFTtm0rVa8t31_miDlLtOfKwrVUH-Pi7R-p0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCNUS1B-BYgXgOlmM24dneiRbBm7V0I85iuKV0b7IwBbw&oe=6A576A39"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kEc0H7QPu-cQ7kNvwEkSssy&_nc_oc=AdoY_CWuqqioiWlz5EJ7Tx50RHX-9Cvr9ejQ6R2M_qR5hvj4wDMx9muEQaSahuhg1y8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAkKXYIy7XDbKnsJ525N29V3pwav19oW5A5xrE-nnPXFA&oe=6A5779D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1EniyMJozHkQ7kNvwE0hxVO&_nc_oc=Ado9UiademobPnqkPJe6_GIVcEkzA9wtgpbjW1DHjmIOBc5uVT6LuoZUSOByg3lamaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC7XJy7xXWWKHLZhGIZbJvspE_RTl2Bi5c0jd8o8d94xg&oe=6A57857B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t9kZZmTOGpEQ7kNvwGkyg5E&_nc_oc=AdoojUm4CtJaF9U4wbqwGhlsG-13MJk_8pOfgq_DL7tog8KkOpnhNyM5FEmbh5g61Bo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAXytJb2240I5b371rBP_bJ2s2E_icdUmXuUtu2e1mbpA&oe=6A5786CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AWdW15Kbeq4Q7kNvwGDzsfw&_nc_oc=AdqPIB5cQTAGJ6GtO5ED2A3FycqzVZ1Kt4lmm5IXpZQNnLoH4l0xtFqF9hDBiIwMpuU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDS5PQFzKUmVutvXkdRJglMMSi9oSfChDHHOtbASN6IgA&oe=6A576FFE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se